	"data": "Godot Spatialize\n\nAddon for \"spatializing\" flat apps into immersive or semi-immersive experiences.\nRepo: <https://github.com/GodotVR/spatialize>\nLicense: MIT\nGodot version: 4.x\nStatus: Official GodotVR org, experimental\n\nWhat It Provides\nTakes flat Godot UI and wraps it for XR spatial display\nSemi-immersive (floating panel) and immersive (wrapped around you) modes\nHandles the rendering pipeline transition from flat to spatial\n\nRelevance\nDirectly relevant to the goal of taking existing flat…",
